      \uB098\uC12D\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    en: 'Hold the Arena and add fighters.

      The strongest fights first.'
  - enabled: 1
    kind: 0
    building: 5
    amount: 1
    research: build
    side: 0
    rewardGold: 1500
    rewardGems: 0
    ko: "\uD734\uAC8C\uC2E4\uC744 \uC9C0\uC73C\uC138\uC694.\n\uB9E4\uC77C 06\uC2DC\uC5D0
      \uC9C0\uC6D0\uAE08\uC744 \uC90D\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC774\uC81C \uB9C8\uC655\uC131\uC740
      \uB2F9\uC2E0 \uB73B\uB300\uB85C!"
    en: 'Build a Lounge.

      It pays a bonus every day at 06:00. The castle is
      yours now!'
